{
  "$mulmocast": {
    "version": "1.1"
  },
  "lang": "ja",
  "title": "Talking avatar over slides",
  "description": "Uses the sample avatar in assets/avatars/ani. Needs the npm packages avatarscript and onnxruntime-node.",
  "avatarParams": {
    "position": {
      "x": "82%",
      "y": "100%",
      "scale": "62%"
    }
  },
  "speechParams": {
    "speakers": {
      "Ani": {
        "provider": "gemini",
        "voiceId": "Leda",
        "speechOptions": {
          "instruction": "Speak in a slightly high-pitched, curt tone with sudden flustered shifts—like a tsundere anime girl."
        },
        "displayName": {
          "ja": "アニ"
        },
        "avatar": {
          "source": "../../assets/avatars/ani"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "beats": [
    {
      "speaker": "Ani",
      "text": "べ、別にあなたのために説明するわけじゃないんだからね！今日は、スライドの上でしゃべるアバターを紹介してあげる。",
      "image": {
        "type": "markdown",
        "markdown": ["# Talking avatars", "", "- MulmoScript + AvatarScript", "- スライドの上でアバターが話す"]
      },
      "avatarParams": {
        "emotion": "happy",
        "motions": [
          {
            "motion": "nod",
            "at": "紹介"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Ani",
      "text": "このアバターはね、メッシュ・アバター・スタジオで、たった一枚のイラストから作ったの。それを、マルモキャストの上で動かしてるのよ。",
      "image": {
        "type": "markdown",
        "markdown": ["# How it's made", "", "- mesh-avatar-studio: 1枚のイラスト → メッシュアバター", "- MulmoCast + AvatarScript: 台本 → 音声 → 口パク動画"]
      },
      "avatarParams": {
        "emotion": "relaxed",
        "motions": [
          {
            "motion": "nod",
            "at": "マルモキャスト"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Ani",
      "text": "位置と大きさは、台本全体で決めておいて、ビートごとに変えられるの。ほら、大きくなったでしょ。ちゃんと見なさいよね！",
      "image": {
        "type": "markdown",
        "markdown": ["# Position and size", "", "- 台本全体: `avatarParams.position`", "- ビートごとに上書き"]
      },
      "avatarParams": {
        "emotion": "relaxed",
        "position": {
          "x": "76%",
          "scale": "82%"
        },
        "motions": [
          {
            "motion": "tilt",
            "at": "大きく"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Ani",
      "text": "ちょ、ちょっと！今度は左に小さくされちゃったんだけど！",
      "image": {
        "type": "markdown",
        "markdown": ["# Moved", "", "```json", "\"avatarParams\": {", "  \"position\": { \"x\": \"18%\", \"scale\": \"48%\" }", "}", "```"]
      },
      "avatarParams": {
        "emotion": "surprised",
        "position": {
          "x": "18%",
          "scale": "48%"
        },
        "motions": [
          {
            "motion": "surprise"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Ani",
      "text": "最後は元の位置に戻るわ。べ、別に、こんなことが簡単にできるって、自慢してるわけじゃないんだからね！",
      "image": {
        "type": "markdown",
        "markdown": ["# 簡単…でしょ？"]
      },
      "avatarParams": {
        "emotion": "angry"
      }
    }
  ]
}
